<title>USA: Park Bancorp Inc Q3 net declines.</title>
<headline>Park Bancorp Inc Q3 net declines.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Net			     11			143</p>
<p>			9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Net			    506			772</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Public trading in the company's stock began on August 9, 1996.</p>
<p>1996 Q3 results include $753,000 charge for Savings Association Insurance Fund recapitalization. The charge was offset by a $292,000 decrease in income tax expense.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
